  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration and <math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math> is"
  },
